Dependencies

- Core: Python standard library only. The Python scripts have no third-party
  dependencies, and no dependency source is vendored in this repository.
- Optional OMP integration (integrations/omp-notifier.ts): TypeScript source
  hosted and executed by the OMP harness. It requires the Bun JavaScript
  runtime, the harness's @oh-my-pi/pi-coding-agent extension API as a peer
  dependency, and a local Python 3 interpreter for the scripts it invokes.
  No dependency source is vendored in this repository.
